  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Western Balkans Investment Framework projects - Infrastructure Project Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is to provide technical assistance for the successful preparation and execution of priority transport, energy, environment and social infrastructure investment projects submitted to the Western Balkans Investment Framework (WBIF) for funding and approved by its Steering Committee.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
